From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:58:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: awinic,aw86927: Add AW86937

Add the Awinic AW86937, an LRA haptic driver of the same family as the
AW86938, used on the Lenovo Legion Y700 (2025). It falls back to the
AW86927 compatible; the driver tells the parts apart by their chip ID.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/awinic,aw86927.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/awinic,aw86927.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/awinic,aw86927.yaml
index bd74b8148..42b8f5f9e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/awinic,aw86927.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/awinic,aw86927.yaml
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ properties:
       - const: awinic,aw86927
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - awinic,aw86937
               - awinic,aw86938
           - const: awinic,aw86927
 
